1
00:00:55,399 --> 00:00:57,079
Yanyan's back.

2
00:01:05,599 --> 00:01:06,840
Yanyan.

3
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:09,680
Do you like this birthday cake?

4
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:18,519
I like it.

5
00:01:33,159 --> 00:01:37,120
Mom...

6
00:01:39,599 --> 00:01:41,879
Don't go.

7
00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:45,439
I won't eat the cake anymore.

8
00:01:45,439 --> 00:01:47,079
Mom...

9
00:01:47,079 --> 00:01:49,959
Mom, please don't go.

10
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:52,640
Don't leave.

11
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:54,319
Mom...

12
00:01:54,319 --> 00:01:56,439
Mom, don't leave.

13
00:01:56,439 --> 00:01:57,400
Mom...

14
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:59,079
Don't go.

15
00:01:59,079 --> 00:02:00,760
Don't leave.

16
00:02:10,599 --> 00:02:11,599
Hello?

17
00:02:11,599 --> 00:02:13,199
In the follow-up interrogation,

18
00:02:13,199 --> 00:02:15,319
Li Changyu told us everything he could,

19
00:02:15,319 --> 00:02:17,240
but he remains completely unrepentant.

20
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:19,240
He resents Wu Qimeng and Wang Lili,

21
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:20,960
and claims someone set him up,

22
00:02:20,960 --> 00:02:22,199
and instigated him to commit murder.

23
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:24,240
Instigating him?

24
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:24,960
Someone told him

25
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:26,240
that the way to remove an obstacle

26
00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:28,520
is to get rid of the person causing it.

27
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:29,639
For Li Changyu,

28
00:02:29,639 --> 00:02:30,960
Wu Qimeng was his obstacle.

29
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:32,840
Not only could she not help his career,

30
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:34,719
she stood between him and Wang Lili.

31
00:02:34,719 --> 00:02:36,879
Li Changyu isn't the kind of fool

32
00:02:36,919 --> 00:02:38,840
who just believes whatever he's told.

33
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:40,360
He'd wanted to kill his wife all along.

34
00:02:40,639 --> 00:02:42,120
Someone else's words

35
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,759
merely acted as a catalyst

36
00:02:43,879 --> 00:02:45,360
to turn that thought into reality.

37
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:48,199
We pressed him on who urged him to do it,

38
00:02:48,199 --> 00:02:51,039
but he couldn't name anyone specific,

39
00:02:51,039 --> 00:02:52,960
nor was he willing to say more.

40
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:54,000
Whether it's a made-up person

41
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:55,560
or someone real,

42
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:57,960
it won't affect Li Changyu's ongoing case.

43
00:02:58,400 --> 00:03:00,520
How was Zhang Dafeng's psych evaluation?

44
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:03,240
He was diagnosed with dual personality.

45
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:05,240
He's in the psychiatric hospital now.

46
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:07,240
I'll let you know once visits are allowed.

47
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:08,319
I'll let you know once visits are allowed.

48
00:03:08,319 --> 00:03:09,240
Okay.

49
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:10,319
Talk later, then.

50
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:13,639
No matter what,

51
00:03:13,639 --> 00:03:15,479
I have to see Zhang Dafeng.

52
00:03:15,479 --> 00:03:17,479
I must find out about the coin.

53
00:03:32,639 --> 00:03:34,520
What's the situation?

54
00:03:34,639 --> 00:03:35,960
She was in a car accident.

55
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:38,280
Her legs were trapped and took the brunt.

56
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:42,719
It was this handsome guy.

57
00:03:42,719 --> 00:03:44,680
He brought you in the day of the crash.

58
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:46,599
He paid your medical bills too.

59
00:03:46,599 --> 00:03:48,560
So he really was the one who saved me.

60
00:03:51,159 --> 00:03:52,439
Dr. Lin.

61
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:54,319
We meet again.

62
00:03:56,520 --> 00:03:58,680
For saving my life...

63
00:03:58,800 --> 00:03:59,759
I should...

64
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:01,599
what was it again?

65
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:04,360
repay with marriage!

66
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:05,639
What are you talking about?

67
00:04:05,639 --> 00:04:06,919
This is my assistant,

68
00:04:06,919 --> 00:04:07,800
Shen Yu.

69
00:04:09,199 --> 00:04:10,520
It's fate.

70
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:11,840
I get it.

71
00:04:12,199 --> 00:04:13,120
Dr. Lin,

72
00:04:13,319 --> 00:04:14,840
I'm here for a follow-up today.

73
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:18,639
You've suffered

74
00:04:18,639 --> 00:04:20,839
partial comminuted fractures in both legs.

75
00:04:20,839 --> 00:04:22,439
With proper rest, you can still recover.

76
00:04:22,439 --> 00:04:24,439
Any worse, and it would've been tricky.

77
00:04:24,879 --> 00:04:26,959
I'll keep an eye on her recovery.

78
00:04:29,319 --> 00:04:30,879
Then what are you waiting for?

79
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:32,720
Hurry up and carry her

80
00:04:33,079 --> 00:04:34,639
over to the bed.

81
00:05:11,519 --> 00:05:13,079
Mom...

82
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:16,399
Don't go.

83
00:05:20,399 --> 00:05:21,600
It's okay now.

84
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:25,079
I'll always be by your side.

85
00:05:48,480 --> 00:05:49,759
That's more like it.

86
00:05:49,759 --> 00:05:51,199
A good assistant needs to be competent.

87
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:53,879
Support her well at work,

88
00:05:53,879 --> 00:05:56,240
and take good care of her daily life.

89
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:57,800
Looks like from now on,

90
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:58,879
the only way we'll see each other

91
00:05:58,879 --> 00:06:00,040
is by booking a hospital appointment.

92
00:06:01,639 --> 00:06:03,199
The station is busy with a case.

93
00:06:03,199 --> 00:06:06,079
Don't you have interns to mentor too?

94
00:06:06,399 --> 00:06:08,920
I really hate how sensible you always are.

95
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:12,079
Stop joking around, Dr. Lin.

96
00:06:12,079 --> 00:06:13,399
Hurry and get back to work.

97
00:06:14,759 --> 00:06:16,439
I think this handsome guy is into you.

98
00:06:16,439 --> 00:06:17,360
Seize the chance.

99
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:18,319
Hey.

100
00:06:18,959 --> 00:06:20,879
Feel free to talk even louder.

101
00:06:20,879 --> 00:06:22,399
I can hear you.

102
00:06:25,079 --> 00:06:26,480
Let me take that.

103
00:06:30,639 --> 00:06:33,480
I'm heading out!

104
00:06:36,959 --> 00:06:39,480
Didn't you say you had a boyfriend?

105
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:42,600
Why'd Dr. Lin say to seize the chance?

106
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:44,920
It's rare to find an anonymous do-gooder

107
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:46,519
who saves a life and pays medical bills,

108
00:06:46,519 --> 00:06:48,639
and eagerly applies for my 2,000-a-month

109
00:06:48,639 --> 00:06:52,439
assistant job as driver, maid, and guard.

110
00:06:52,439 --> 00:06:54,399
Where else would I find someone like that?

111
00:06:54,399 --> 00:06:55,360
Of course I have to seize the chance

112
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:56,639
to boss you around as much as I can.

113
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:01,079
Gu Yan.

114
00:07:01,079 --> 00:07:02,079
Yeah?

115
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:03,759
Do you believe in love at first sight?

116
00:07:05,519 --> 00:07:06,920
Rather than love at first sight,

117
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:09,160
I believe love grows over time.

118
00:07:11,199 --> 00:07:11,800
Yeah.

119
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:15,600
I believe love grows over time, too.

120
00:07:28,279 --> 00:07:29,279
This coin.

121
00:07:29,279 --> 00:07:30,240
What about it?

122
00:07:41,959 --> 00:07:43,399
This coin

123
00:07:43,839 --> 00:07:46,240
is different from regular currency.

124
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:48,360
It looks like an arcade token.

125
00:08:11,959 --> 00:08:13,079
It's gold-plated.

126
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:15,040
The coin from back then

127
00:08:15,040 --> 00:08:16,360
was made of tin,

128
00:08:16,959 --> 00:08:18,279
but other than that,

129
00:08:18,279 --> 00:08:20,199
all the other details are identical.

130
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:34,919
Why did it have to appear right when I

131
00:08:34,919 --> 00:08:38,039
came to the hospital for a follow-up?

132
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:49,639
Excuse me,

133
00:08:49,639 --> 00:08:51,799
did you find this gold coin?

134
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:55,159
Is this yours?

135
00:08:55,799 --> 00:08:57,120
Yes, it's mine.

136
00:08:57,240 --> 00:08:58,480
It's really nice.

137
00:08:58,480 --> 00:08:59,360
How did you get it?

138
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:03,960
We went to an escape room over the weekend

139
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:05,279
and won it as a prize.

140
00:09:05,879 --> 00:09:07,200
An escape room?

141
00:09:07,399 --> 00:09:08,399
They recently opened

142
00:09:08,399 --> 00:09:09,399
a Great Escape Room in Ancheng.

143
00:09:09,399 --> 00:09:11,279
It has a lot of different themed rooms.

144
00:09:11,279 --> 00:09:12,759
If players clear the first three stages,

145
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:14,480
they get this commemorative gold coin.

146
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:16,519
I see. Thank you.

147
00:09:17,519 --> 00:09:19,320
Sure. Bye!

148
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:22,200
They must be college students

149
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:23,480
interning here at the hospital.

150
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:26,000
The guy who just spoke to you

151
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:27,759
interns under Lin Zi.

152
00:09:27,759 --> 00:09:29,120
Shen Yu.

153
00:09:29,120 --> 00:09:31,440
Look into that escape room for me.
